{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-8-20","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：平面与比例与整数","englishTitle":"If one mean proportional number fall between two numbers, the numbers will be similar plane numbers.","book":8,"number":20,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.20","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.20/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":20,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-8-20@raw-d631e41f64873138","contentId":"euclid-8-20","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d631e41f64873138840e3fb523308c53a7d56c16dbca6009acabc62c41127f60","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-8-20.statement","euclid-8-20.construction.1","euclid-8-20.construction.2","euclid-8-20.proof.1","euclid-8-20.proof.2","euclid-8-20.proof.3","euclid-8-20.proof.4","euclid-8-20.proof.5","euclid-8-20.proof.6","euclid-8-20.proof.7","euclid-8-20.proof.8","euclid-8-20.proof.9","euclid-8-20.proof.10","euclid-8-20.conclusion","euclid-8-20.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-8-20.statement","contentId":"euclid-8-20","revisionId":"euclid-8-20@raw-d631e41f64873138","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b4a8d7254179916b0e98853957a6c63f13cd21c04607daa4e071051a9d8c2c00","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If one mean proportional number fall between two numbers, the numbers will be similar plane numbers."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个比例中项数字在两个数字之间下降, 数字将是相似平面数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-20.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-8-20","revisionId":"euclid-8-20@raw-d631e41f64873138","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ed28b96feb7bf78b14f5e3c96bf5c9624b8b5c9289da03df38995bf60e02c6c4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let one mean proportional number C fall between the two numbers A, B; I say that A, B are similar plane numbers."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让一个比例中项码C在两个数字A、B之间下降;我说A,B是相似平面数"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-20.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-8-20","revisionId":"euclid-8-20@raw-d631e41f64873138","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6ac96929a7da8df27861c7c3bd6d41908f1e8691538065c28cc3658ee9beec3d","citations":["euclid-7-33","euclid-7-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let D, E, the least numbers of those which have the same ratio with A, C, be taken; [[VII. 33](/principles/euclid-7-33)] therefore D measures A the same number of times that E measures C. [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"D,E, 与A,C比相同的数字最少;因此,D,整除,A次是E,整除,C次的两倍。 [[VII. 33](/principles/euclid-7-33)] [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-20.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-8-20","revisionId":"euclid-8-20@raw-d631e41f64873138","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bbc6942261f393a5a7512925eb5e14ff6dd7c5db649a75b425f19a322cb5fd2d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, as many times as D measures A, so many units let there be in F; therefore F by multiplying D has made A, so that A is plane, and D, F are its sides."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,F是D 整除 A的两倍,单位是F,F乘以D,A是D,D是F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-20.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-8-20","revisionId":"euclid-8-20@raw-d631e41f64873138","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6027c23fdf5e72886550f47014a9052b13d26be1037132f3e70a4c9fa872730c","citations":["euclid-7-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since D, E are the least of the numbers which have the same ratio with C, B, therefore D measures C the same number of times that E measures B. [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,自D以来,E是C中比例相同的B中最少的人,因此,D 整除 C次是E 整除 B次的两倍。 [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-20.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-8-20","revisionId":"euclid-8-20@raw-d631e41f64873138","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"578db648b30eb5247c8772c2d6e00abdb923a5a5d6a696e427bdd3892fbf038a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"As many times, then, as E measures B, so many units let there be in G; therefore E measures B according to the units in G; therefore G by multiplying E has made B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"G,有E 整除 B,因此,G,有E 整除 B,因此,G,有E 整除 B,因此,G,乘以E, 使B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-20.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-8-20","revisionId":"euclid-8-20@raw-d631e41f64873138","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2befcca7c8f513db58d181bbc7d21197ecfb51270a1819ed6dd94dc570161e86","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore B is plane, and E, G are its sides."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,B是平面,E,G是其两面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-20.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-8-20","revisionId":"euclid-8-20@raw-d631e41f64873138","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ca12f322f6a756cbcf368f21ef8fe9ecfa5f56ab95c706d70abcc1662904dbb7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A, B are plane numbers."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A,B是平面数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-20.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-8-20","revisionId":"euclid-8-20@raw-d631e41f64873138","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"db7ed139970eeabeaa2586666285fd1c9e023988573cebefa5f6555ff5796eb0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that they are also similar."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,它们也是类似的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-20.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-8-20","revisionId":"euclid-8-20@raw-d631e41f64873138","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e84bb05d6ee44da2fc64f1ea824e5fd63b1d833af3783bbf6f7618c37370555e","citations":["euclid-7-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, † since F by multiplying D has made A, and by multiplying E has made C, therefore, as D is to E, so is A to C, that is, C to B. [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"以D乘F计算,A乘A,E乘C,D乘C,D乘C,A乘C,C等于C乘C；D 与 E 之比等于 A 与 C 之比。（相关点与线段：B） [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-20.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-8-20","revisionId":"euclid-8-20@raw-d631e41f64873138","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b97d8cbf03bbf9b899803f56bce1f339e58ba5133934fea41ba622829547160b","citations":["euclid-7-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, † since E by multiplying F, G has made C, B respectively, therefore, as F is to G, so is C to B. [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,自E乘以F、G,分别达到C、B,F比G等于C比B；F 与 G 之比等于 C 与 B 之比。 [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-20.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-8-20","revisionId":"euclid-8-20@raw-d631e41f64873138","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7008dc0d0e4719dae69ed190b2da3e40cdf45df9a45f1543f1629cfa627384fb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as C is to B, so is D to E; therefore also, as D is to E, so is F to G."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,C对B的比等于D对E的比;因此,D对E的比等于F对G的比；C 与 B 之比等于 D 与 E 之比；D 与 E 之比等于 F 与 G 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-20.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-8-20","revisionId":"euclid-8-20@raw-d631e41f64873138","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b9b66b59126044f0ea38c8591b8d0063e45855bf4556b94e97d8895116e81cd7","citations":["euclid-7-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And alternately, as D is to F, so is E to G. [[VII. 13](/principles/euclid-7-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"反过来,D比F的比例等于E比G；D 与 F 之比等于 E 与 G 之比。 [[VII. 13](/principles/euclid-7-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-20.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-8-20","revisionId":"euclid-8-20@raw-d631e41f64873138","order":13,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9fe80bebd8eb9563ad3f7e163cc63fb682f2051435069a278fc8f035d81fee8f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A, B are similar plane numbers; for their sides are proportional. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A,B是相似平面数;它们的两边是成比例,Q,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-20.source","contentId":"euclid-8-20","revisionId":"euclid-8-20@raw-d631e41f64873138","order":14,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f6bc7c3fd44be9521452a5e7c2b2750c48c42f042a2f5b6823df50701f95399d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.20/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.20\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-8-20:euclid-7-33:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-8-20","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-8-20.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-33","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.20","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.20/","sourceLabel":"VII. 33"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-8-20:euclid-7-20:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-8-20","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-8-20.construction.2","euclid-8-20.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-20","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.